question:
Verified Three-Request Example

Given the following token sets:
req1 = {GET, /api, token=abc, id=5}
req2 = {GET, /api, token=xyz, id=5}
req3 = {GET, /api, token=def, id=6}

(a) Compute the intersection size and union size for each of the three pairs: (req1,req2), (req1,req3), (req2,req3).
(b) Compute the pairwise Jaccard similarity for each pair.
(c) Compute the mean pairwise Jaccard similarity across all three pairs.
(d) State whether a rate-limit would trigger at tau = $0.70$, and explain why.
